      "text": "It is clear that s(n, k) are integers not depending on f(x).\nDe\ufb01nition 1. The integers s(n, k), (n \u22651, k = 1, . . . , n) are called Stirling\nnumbers of the \ufb01rst kind. We also de\ufb01ne s(0, 0) = 1 and s(n, k) = 0, for n < k.\n",
